        Y: -1.0
        Z: 0.0
      Name: 🌐 2. Swarm 3D Perspective (Isometric)
      Near Clip Distance: 0.01
      Pitch: 0.65
      Target Frame: world
      Value: Orbit (rviz_default_plugins)
      Yaw: -1.570796
    - Class: rviz_default_plugins/ThirdPersonFollower
      Distance: 3.5
      Focal Point:
        X: 0.0
        Y: 0.0
        Z: 0.0
      Name: 🚗 3. Iris 1 (Teal) - Chase View Forward
